# Renderer rules

- `src/` is UI only. Never import Node, Electron, `fs`, `child_process`, or agent-core from React.
- Call privileged work through `window.rata`.
- Character components consume `CharacterState` only. They must not decide tools or policy.
- Reuse Control Center visual language in `src/styles/global.css` for new pages.
- Keep hooks in `src/hooks/` and page sections under `src/views/control/`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
import { spawn } from 'node:child_process'

// ✅ GOOD
await window.rata.agentMessage('open notepad')
```
